and Margaret Busby.\\\"Imagine the World\\\", Africa39.\\n\\nDeath\\n\\nOn 29 June 2016, Amadi died at the Good Heart Hospital in Port Harcourt at ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elechi_Amadi\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d66\"},\"ref\":\"d66\",\"snippet\":\" ... to celebrate my birthday on Valentines Day, two weeks after my birthday. They said it was the day I came home and they knew I was healthy, I was a little under 5lbs at birth, so the doctor kept me in the hospital for two weeks.\\n\\nI was ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.opentohope.com/sharing-the-experience-of-being-a-twinless-twin/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d67\"},\"ref\":\"d67\",\"snippet\":\" ... The opening theme discloses that Captain Star's renowned heroics involved renaming inhabited planets after himself, akin to explorers during the colonial era renaming and claiming lands for Europe. He would then proceed to sell unnecessary items to the inhabitants, like a group of aliens purchasing umbrellas before ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Captain_Star\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"2930a63720ea929d427e8b33bafaa5b6496e45be77f692304e4eb6105a12606e\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"b7bd42e55d6e328b68b801abfa8e29a6698bae29d1844abed2622bb442b74f81\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"two children same birthday hospital renamed after birth\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_16bad5db74824e18a7d28af4"},{"content":"Current control state (data, not source evidence):\n{\"current_notes_not_evidence\":[],\"evidence_shelf\":{\"omi